      "message": "It seems here passing the starttime\u003d0 is clearing the data (or the unlock step).\n\nI\u0027m guessing this means state is managed on the vendorhook side? Though as the lock isn\u0027t passed in, what happens if lock/unlock ordering of multiple locks are not trivially nested? lock(a); lock(b); unlock(a); unlock(b) ?",
